<?php if ($result['review']): ?><p class="result-warning">Fixed-term early resignation needs individual review. This is the full accrued Article 51 benefit before any Article 47 compensation or other adjustment; it is not a final payable settlement.</p><?php elseif ($values['reason'] === 'article41'): ?><p class="result-warning">Zero assumes a dismissal that validly meets Article 41(a). Other dismissal grounds may preserve indemnity.</p><?php elseif ($values['reason'] === 'resignation'): ?><p class="result-note">Article 53: under 3 years, no benefit; 3–5 years inclusive, half; over 5–under 10, two-thirds; 10 or more, full benefit.</p><?php else: ?><p class="result-note">Full entitlement assumes an eligible termination or contract expiry under Article 52.</p><?php endif ?>
